      "id": "claim_8945028f72dc47c2adb6676bdfbd39d0",
      "statement": "fleet-check.sh checks end-state results, not the order of work, running fixed checks in order: receipt, intent, report, decisions, acceptance, security, repro, suite; in block mode it exits 1 on any mismatch, in warn mode it always exits 0.",
